      "text": "រក t₁, t₂ ឫសសមីការ -t²+2t-4=0 ។ សរសេរ Z = 4t₂/t₁³ ជាទម្រង់ត្រីកោណ",
      "normalizedText": "Find complex roots t₁, t₂ of -t²+2t-4=0. t₁=1-√3i=2(cos(5π/3)+isin(5π/3)), t₂=1+√3i=2(cos(π/3)+isin(π/3)). Compute t₁³=8(cosπ+isinπ). Then Z=4t₂/t₁³=cos(4π/3)+isin(4π/3).",
      "problem": {
        "textKh": "រក t₁, t₂ ហើយ Z = 4t₂/t₁³ ជាទម្រង់ត្រីកោណ",
        "text": "Find roots of -t²+2t-4=0 and express Z=4t₂/t₁³ in trigonometric form",
        "latex": "-t^2+2t-4=0;\\ Z=\\frac{4t_2}{t_1^3}"
      },
      "solutionSteps": [
        {
          "textKh": "គណនា Δ = b²-4ac",
          "text": "Discriminant of -t²+2t-4=0 (equivalent to t²-2t+4=0)",
          "latex": "\\Delta = 2^2 - 4(-1)(-4) = 4-16 = -12 \\implies \\sqrt{\\Delta}=2i\\sqrt{3}"
        },
        {
          "textKh": "ឫស t₁ = (b+√Δ)/2a (using a=-1)",
          "text": "Roots (note a=-1)",
          "latex": "t_1 = \\frac{-2+2i\\sqrt{3}}{2(-1)} = 1-\\sqrt{3}i, \\quad t_2 = \\frac{-2-2i\\sqrt{3}}{2(-1)} = 1+\\sqrt{3}i"
        },
        {
          "textKh": "ទម្រង់ t ត្រីកោណ t₁",
          "text": "Polar form of t₁",
          "latex": "t_1 = 2\\left(\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}i\\right) = 2\\left(\\cos\\frac{5\\pi}{3}+i\\sin\\frac{5\\pi}{3}\\right)"
        },
        {
          "textKh": "t₁³ ដោយ De Moivre",
          "text": "t₁³ by De Moivre's theorem",
          "latex": "t_1^3 = 2^3\\left(\\cos\\frac{15\\pi}{3}+i\\sin\\frac{15\\pi}{3}\\right) = 8(\\cos 5\\pi+i\\sin 5\\pi) = 8(\\cos\\pi+i\\sin\\pi)"
        },
        {
          "textKh": "ទម្រង់ t ត្រីកោណ t₂",
          "text": "Polar form of t₂",
          "latex": "t_2 = 2\\left(\\cos\\frac{\\pi}{3}+i\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)"
        },
        {
          "textKh": "គណនា Z = 4t₂/t₁³",
          "text": "Compute Z by dividing polar forms",
          "latex": "Z = \\frac{4\\cdot 2\\left(\\cos\\frac{\\pi}{3}+i\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)}{8(\\cos\\pi+i\\sin\\pi)} = \\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{3}-\\pi\\right)+i\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{3}-\\pi\\right)"
        },
        {
          "textKh": "សំព្រួញ",
          "text": "Simplify angle: π/3-π = -2π/3 ≡ 4π/3",
          "latex": "Z = \\cos\\left(-\\frac{2\\pi}{3}\\right)+i\\sin\\left(-\\frac{2\\pi}{3}\\right) = \\cos\\frac{4\\pi}{3}+i\\sin\\frac{4\\pi}{3}"
        }
      ],
      "finalAnswer": {
        "textKh": "t₁=1-√3i, t₂=1+√3i | Z = cos(4π/3)+i sin(4π/3)",
        "text": "t₁=1-√3i, t₂=1+√3i. Z=cos(4π/3)+isin(4π/3).",
        "latex": "t_1=1-\\sqrt{3}i;\\ t_2=1+\\sqrt{3}i;\\ Z=\\cos\\frac{4\\pi}{3}+i\\sin\\frac{4\\pi}{3}"
      },
      "formulas": [
        {
          "latex": "z^n = r^n(\\cos n\\theta+i\\sin n\\theta)",
          "meaning": "De Moivre's theorem",
          "confidence": 0.99
        },
        {
          "latex": "\\frac{z_1}{z_2}=\\frac{r_1}{r_2}(\\cos(\\theta_1-\\theta_2)+i\\sin(\\theta_1-\\theta_2))",
          "meaning": "Division of complex numbers in polar form",
          "confidence": 0.99
        }
