      "text": "ដោះស្រាយ (F): y'' - 2y' + 5y = 0 ជាមួយ y(0)=2 និង y'(0)=6",
      "normalizedText": "Solve (F): y''-2y'+5y=0 with initial conditions y(0)=2, y'(0)=6. Characteristic equation r²-2r+5=0 has complex roots r=1±2i. General solution y=e^x(Acos2x+Bsin2x). Applying conditions: A=2, B=2. Particular solution: y=e^x(2cos2x+2sin2x).",
      "problem": {
        "textKh": "ដោះស្រាយ (F): y''-2y'+5y=0 ជាមួយ y(0)=2, y'(0)=6",
        "text": "Solve ODE y''-2y'+5y=0 with y(0)=2, y'(0)=6",
        "latex": "(F):\\ y''-2y'+5y=0,\\ y(0)=2,\\ y'(0)=6"
      },
      "solutionSteps": [
        {
          "textKh": "សមីការលក្ខណៈ",
          "text": "Characteristic equation",
          "latex": "r^2-2r+5=0 \\implies \\Delta=4-20=-16 \\implies \\sqrt{\\Delta}=4i"
