        {
          "textKh": "ឫស (ចំនួនកុំផ្លិច)",
          "text": "Complex roots",
          "latex": "r_1 = \\frac{2-4i}{2}=1-2i,\\quad r_2=\\frac{2+4i}{2}=1+2i"
